=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_3e7a (fork of p_a1b2) — Charger on person during work; remote migrates to floor; laptop in active use

This is a fork of p_a1b2 with three targeted changes driven by the evidence. First, Marco's charger is almost never visible at his desk during work hours (1/38 looks found it, 37 found nothing), yet it is reliably at the desk at 03:00, 09:00, 17:00, and 18:00. The most parsimonious explanation is that Marco carries his phone (and its charger) on his person during the 10-to-16 work window. Second, the remote follows a clear weekday evening migration: tv_stand through the afternoon, coffee_table at 21:00, floor at 22:00. The parent document put it on the coffee table for the whole evening, but the 22:00 sighting on the floor is consistent across multiple passes. Third, Marco's laptop is at the desk (5/5 sighted days) but the robot finds it only 8/38 times during 9–17h; it is in active use, screen facing Marco, and not always visible from the robot's vantage. The chance is lowered to "usually" to reflect this.

What changed from p_a1b2: charger_marco gets an ON_PERSON block 10–16h weekday; class:remote gets a three-stage evening migration (tv_stand → coffee_table → floor); laptop_marco chance drops from "almost_always" to "usually"; class:snack_bowl gains an evening coffee_table block.

What would refute it: charger_marco sighted at desk_b1 at 13:00 on a weekday; remote on the tv_stand at 22:30 on a weekday; laptop_marco sighted at a location other than desk_b1 during 9–17h.

